    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      407.59,
      286.4,
      475.24
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      476.71,
      286.47,
      578.72
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or servitude to be acquired: Under mentioned allotments of land shown in the surveyor General\u2019s plan of FVP 129, Supplement No. 13, Sheet No.18 Prepared by Matara Surveyour Superintendant, situated in the village of Mulatiyana, Neralampitiya Grama Niladari Division, Mulatiyana Divisional Secretarys Division in Matara District Southern Province:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      580.16,
      286.4,
      670.88
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 228; Name of the land: Ihalawatta; Description : Two Permanent buildings, a toilet, water tank and Garden; Claimants: Ariyalata Hemali Rathnayaka, N.B. Rathnayaka, Anurudda Dewapriya Rathnayaka, Dunidu Rathnayaka, Renuka Rathnayaka, Dammika Ramani Rathnayaka, Ranjani Rathnayaka, and Sudarmavo Jinami",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      334.16,
      539.57,
      355.76
    ],
    "text": "Rathnayaka on behalf of late Piyadasa Rathnayaka; Extent of the Land: 0.2702 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      357.2,
      541.98,
      424.64
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 229; Name of the land: Ilanganwatta alias Kirilapanewatta; Description: Garden, permanent building and Buddh image house; Claimants: L. H. Ranasinghe; Extent: 0.0371 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      426.08,
      539.6,
      654.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land / lands on which a servitude is to the acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writting, before me at the Divisional Secretariat Mulatiyana on the 29th day of March, 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd day of March 2017, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. SUSANTHA ATTANAYAKA, Divisional Secretary, Mulatiyana. Divisional Secretariat Office, Mulatiyana, 25th January, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
